[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_9999","text":"电视的声音\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0010","text":"『如果条件都满足的话，可以看到很多星星哦\n　不过，根据天气情况也可能看不到那么多——』\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0020","text":"啊，流星雨……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0030","text":"小时候，大家一起去看过呢～\n嘿嘿，好怀念啊\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0040","text":"对了！　今年也叫上千雪小姐\n一起去看吧！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0050","text":"那样，挺好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0060","text":"辛苦了……！\n啊，甘奈、甜花！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0070","text":"千雪小姐！　正好！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0080","text":"呵呵，其实啊\n我也有事要找你们俩\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0090","text":"不过，是甘奈先说了“正好”呢\n那就甘奈你们先说吧\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0100","text":"嘿嘿，谢谢！\n今年的流星雨，要不要跟甘奈她们一起看？\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0110","text":"好像会看到很多……所以\n可以许好多愿望哦……！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0120","text":"哇，好棒的邀请\n请务必让我一起\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0130","text":"太好了——！／太好了……！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0140","text":"那么，接下来轮到我了……\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0150","text":"好的，千雪诊所\n黛太郎先生，出院了♪\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0160","text":"哇……！\n千雪小姐……谢谢……！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0170","text":"我说怎么没看到它呢～\n嘿嘿，原来是拿去修了啊～\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0180","text":"嘿嘿……今年的流星雨……\n和黛太郎一起……！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0190","text":"……阿嚏！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0200","text":"没事吧！？／没事吧……？\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_04_0012","text":"Motion"}]
